This directory holds Story-section photography.

Drop the family photo here as:
  jacobs-family-bamboo-fire-cafe-delray-beach.jpg

Recommended specs:
  - 4:5 aspect ratio (portrait)
  - At least 1200x1500 px
  - JPG, ~80% quality, color-corrected
  - File size under 400 KB (use a tool like squoosh.app)

Story.tsx checks for the file at build time. As soon as the file is committed and the
site redeploys, the placeholder is replaced with the photo automatically.

Filename convention (see content/restaurant.ts header for the full rule):
  [brand]-[subject]-[location].jpg
